# Widescreen display, the option menu's switch of the wide screen, from
# the main menu on a display of 1920x1080 (fixtures/widemenu: holomap's
# save outside the prison, fixtures/outside, and the CD's LBA.CFG with
# WideScreen: OFF, recorded with -D 1920x1080). The option menu's
# seventh entry says Widescreen display: OFF. Return turns it ON: the
# screen 852x480, the menu in the window and the main menu's picture in
# its middle, black beside it, and WideScreen: ON written to lba.cfg.
# Return turns it OFF, the screen 640x480 again, and Return again ON.
# The first entry goes back to the main menu, its picture in the
# window, and Continue saved game loads the save: the scene on the
# whole screen of 852x480. Keys are short, as in options.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot off
key Down Down Down Down Down Down
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 2
shot on
key Return
sleep 2
shot offagain
key Return
sleep 2
shot onagain
key Up Up Up Up Up Up
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 3
shot main
key Up Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 15
shot scene
